---
// https://www.protelsystems.cz/sk/o-protel (Solid Pixels), port 1:1 skriptem port-protel.py
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import VyzkousetZdarmaSk from '../../components/blocks/VyzkousetZdarmaSk.astro';
import NovinkySk from '../../components/blocks/NovinkySk.astro';
import KontaktniFormularSk from '../../components/blocks/KontaktniFormularSk.astro';
---
<Base
  title="O Protel | Hotel PMS Protel"
  description="Naším cieľom je spríjemniť a zefektívniť prevádzku hotela pre všetkých, ktorí sa na nej podieľajú. Od hotelierov a upratovačiek až po recepčných a kuchárov v hotelovej kuchyni. Hotelový PMS Protel optimalizuje náklady, šetrí ľudské zdroje a zvyšuje efektivitu práce."
  path="/sk/o-protel"
  bodyClass="use-header-transparent use-menu-secondary-uppercase use-menu-button-uppercase use-headings-link-plain search-panel-hide-submit-label search-panel-hide-close-label search-panel-hide-open-label use-menu-bar use-header-fixed use-header-fixed-mobile use-header-priority use-header-boxed"
  locale="sk"
  image="/files/nahled-digitalni-recepce.jpg"
>
<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default section-width-narrow no-pb"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-inline"><p class="center"><strong>PROTEL HOTEL PMS</strong></p>
</div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h1 class="center">Hotel Property Management System<font color="#ff0096"><span style="caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 150);">.</span></font></h1>
</div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-inline"><p class="center text-large">Naším cieľom je spríjemniť a zefektívniť prevádzku hotelov pre všetkých, ktorí sa podieľajú na hotelovom chode. Od hoteliérov, chyžných cez recepčných až po kuchárov v hotelovej kuchyni. PMS hotelový systém Protel optimalizuje náklady, šetrí ľudské zdroje a zlepšuje efektivitu práce, čím vytvára príjemnejšie a produktívnejšie pracovné prostredie. Sme partnerom pre každého, kto chce svoj hotel riadiť moderne. Pre všetkých, ktorí to myslia so svojím hotelom vážne a chcú svojim hosťom pripraviť naozaj skvelý zážitok.</p>
</div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-button"><div class="center"><a class="btn btn-default btn-sm" href="/sk/demo-zadarmo"><span aria-hidden="true" class="btn__icon"></span><span class="btn__label">CHCEM VEDIEŤ VIAC</span></a></div></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-image no-pb"><div class="image image-mask ratio-original" style="padding-bottom:60.416666666666664%"><img alt="" decoding="async" sizes="(min-width:931px) 931px, (min-width:720px) 100.00vw, 100.00vw" src="/files/r/1280/na-miru-dobrym-hotelum.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/na-miru-dobrym-hotelum.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/na-miru-dobrym-hotelum.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/na-miru-dobrym-hotelum.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default no-pt section-has-background"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-image block-image--light-blue no-edge-mobile mobile-order-reverse"><div class="flexcard flexcard-card flexcard-size--normal flexcard-media-right valign-middle align-left flexcard-media--stretch"><div class="flexcard-media"><div class="image-wrapper"><a class="image image-mask ratio-original" href="/sk/kontakt" style="padding-bottom:55.55555555555556%"><img alt="Sme jedni z vás!" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width:1390px) 695px, (min-width:720px) 50.00vw, 100.00vw" src="/files/r/1280/banner-hp.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/banner-hp.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/banner-hp.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/banner-hp.webp 1920w"/></a></div></div><div class="flexcard-content"><div class="flexcard-content-wrapper"><div class="text-block"><h2>Sme jedni z vás!</h2>
<p>Naši konzultanti sú skúsení odborníci z hotelového biznisu, ktorých nakoniec zlákal svet softvéru. Dostávate tak rady od ľudí skúsených z reálnych hotelových prevádzok. Neporadia Vám len ako nainštalovať Protel, ale pomôžu Vám reálne zvýšiť výkonnosť celého hotela.</p>
</div><div class="image-btn"><a class="btn btn-inverse btn-sm" href="/sk/kontakt"><span aria-hidden="true" class="btn__icon"></span><span class="btn__label">POĎME PREBRAŤ DETAILY</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-image has-border-bottom no-edge-mobile block-image--white mobile-order-reverse"><div class="flexcard flexcard-card flexcard-size--normal flexcard-media-left valign-middle align-left flexcard-media--stretch"><div class="flexcard-media"><div class="image-wrapper"><div class="image image-mask ratio-original" style="padding-bottom:55.55555555555556%"><img alt="Fantastický hotel" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width:1390px) 695px, (min-width:720px) 50.00vw, 100.00vw" src="/files/r/1280/banner-uspesny-podnik.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/banner-uspesny-podnik.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/banner-uspesny-podnik.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/banner-uspesny-podnik.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><div class="flexcard-content"><div class="flexcard-content-wrapper"><div class="text-block"><h2>Fantastický hotel<span class="text-highlight">.</span></h2>
<p>Chceme, aby bol Váš hotel úspešný. Priamo fantastický! Chceme, aby sa k vám ľudia radi vracali. Preto sa postaráme o efektívne prevádzkové zázemie Vašej prevádzky, aby ste mali čas a priestor sa sústrediť na to hlavné: spokojného hosťa!</p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section-background" style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"></div></div>
<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default col-gaps-bigger section-has-background"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-gallery grid-sm-2"><div class="grid gallery-container" style="--gap:40px"><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><a class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch" href="/sk/demo-zadarmo"><img alt="Logo TMR Hotels" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-tmr-hotels.svg"/></a></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><a class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch" href="/sk/demo-zadarmo"><img alt="Logo Vysoké Tatry" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-vysoke-tatry.svg"/></a></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><a class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch" href="/sk/demo-zadarmo"><img alt="Logo Hotel Yasmin" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-hotel-yasmin.svg"/></a></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><a class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch" href="/sk/demo-zadarmo"><img alt="Logo Tri Studničky" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-tri-studnicky.svg"/></a></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><a class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch" href="/sk/demo-zadarmo"><img alt="Logo Grandhotel Starý Smokovec" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-grandhotel-stary-smokovec.svg"/></a></div></div><div class="gallery-item grid-col-6"><div class="image-wrapper"><a class="image image-mask ratio-square image-width-stretch" href="/sk/demo-zadarmo"><img alt="Vaše logo" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/ref-vase-referencie.svg"/></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section-background" style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"></div></div>
<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-3-12"><div class="block block-box box box--primary box--full-height box-inherit-color"><div class="row"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h3><a href="/sk/kontakt">Kontakt<span class="text-highlight">.</span></a></h3>
</div></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-4-12 grid-3-12"><div class="block block-box box box--primary box--full-height box-inherit-color"><div class="row"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h3><a href="/sk/cennik-licencii">Cenník licencií<span class="text-highlight">.</span></a></h3>
</div></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-7-12 grid-3-12"><div class="block block-box box box--primary box--full-height box-inherit-color"><div class="row"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h3><a href="/sk/cennik-sluzieb">Cenník služieb<span class="text-highlight">.</span></a></h3>
</div></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-10-12 grid-3-12"><div class="block block-box box box--primary box--full-height box-inherit-color"><div class="row"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h3><a href="/sk/podpora">Helpdesk a Hotline<span class="text-highlight">.</span></a></h3>
</div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-3-12"><div class="block block-box box box--primary box--full-height box-inherit-color"><div class="row"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h3><a href="/sk/produkty">Produkty<span class="text-highlight">.</span></a></h3>
</div></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-4-12 grid-3-12"><div class="block block-box box box--primary box--full-height box-inherit-color"><div class="row"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h3><a href="/sk/napojenie">Napojenie<span class="text-highlight">.</span></a></h3>
</div></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-7-12 grid-3-12"><div class="block block-box box box--primary box--full-height box-inherit-color"><div class="row"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h3><a href="/sk/novinky">Novinky<span class="text-highlight">.</span></a></h3>
</div></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-10-12 grid-3-12"><div class="block block-box box box--primary box--full-height box-inherit-color"><div class="row"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-inline"><h3><a href="/sk/protel-pre-skoly">Protel pre školy<span class="text-highlight">.</span></a></h3>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-image no-pt no-pb block-image--light-blue"><div class="flexcard flexcard-card flexcard-size--normal flexcard-media-right valign-middle align-left flexcard-media--stretch"><div class="flexcard-media"><div class="image-wrapper"><a class="image image-mask ratio-original" href="/novinky-kariera" style="padding-bottom:55.55555555555556%"><img alt="Kariéra v Proteli" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width:1390px) 695px, (min-width:720px) 50.00vw, 100.00vw" src="/files/r/1280/banner-protel-kariera.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/banner-protel-kariera.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/banner-protel-kariera.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/banner-protel-kariera.webp 1920w"/></a></div></div><div class="flexcard-content"><div class="flexcard-content-wrapper"><div class="text-block"><h2>Kariéra v Proteli<span class="text-highlight">.</span></h2>
<p>Milujete svet hotelov, pohostinstvo a máte vzťah k technológiám a IT? Kariéra v Proteli Vás zavedie k jednotke medzi hotelovými systémami v Českej republike a na Slovensku. Myslíte, že môžete byť prínosom pre Protel? Napíšte nám na <a href="mailto:kariera@protelsystems.cz">sales@protelsystems.cz</a> a my sa Vám ozveme.</p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="section height--normal align--middle color--default section-has-background"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-image"><div class="flexcard flexcard-card flexcard-size--small flexcard-media-right valign-center align-left"><div class="flexcard-media"><div class="image-wrapper"><a class="image image-mask ratio-original" href="/sk/o-protel#kontaktni-formular" style="padding-bottom:100%"><img alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/vyhoda-hoteloveho-systemu-protel.svg"/></a></div></div><div class="flexcard-content"><div class="flexcard-content-wrapper"><div class="text-block"><h2><span class="text-highlight">"</span> Protel je celosvetovo uznávaný hotelový systém s plnou miestnou podporou. Jednoduché používanie, prehľadnosť a množstvo pokročilých funkcií z neho robia lídra na slovenskom a českom trhu!</h2>
</div><div class="image-btn"><a class="btn btn-default btn-sm" href="/sk/o-protel#kontaktni-formular"><span aria-hidden="true" class="btn__icon"></span><span class="btn__label">KONTAKTUJTE NÁS</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="section-background" style="background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"></div></div>
<VyzkousetZdarmaSk />
<NovinkySk />
<KontaktniFormularSk />
</Base>
